{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "MOFA 的输入描述允许各数据矩阵来自相同或重叠的样本集合，因此它并不强制要求两个 view 的样本完全一一对应。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 cell_identity_link=none 表示两个 view 之间没有细胞身份对应关系，这属于样本重叠程度未知的情况，而不是已确认的完全不重叠。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:cell_identity_link"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "在完全没有样本对应关系时，MOFA 无法利用跨 view 的配对信息来约束共享因子，其跨模态整合能力会受到限制。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：现有来源只说明输入可以是相同或重叠样本，并未定义任意缺失或完全不重叠情况下的通用兼容性规则，因此不能据此断言你的两个队列一定适合 MOFA。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个 view 之间是否存在任何可用的样本或细胞对应关系，例如部分重叠的样本 ID 或可映射的细胞标签？",
    "missing_field": "sample_overlap_info",
    "why_needed": "MOFA 的输入描述允许相同或重叠样本，但未定义完全不重叠时的兼容性；知道是否存在部分重叠会直接改变该方法是否适用于你的数据。"
  }
}
